<Layout title="About the collective" description="Four friends met through art online. Burrito grew from there. Meet the artist and event collective behind the exhibitions."><PageIntro eyebrow="Meet Burrito" title="We’re here for each other." text="Four friends met through art online. Burrito grew from there." /><section class="wrap page-content"><p class="about-statement">We bring artists together to show work, share ideas, and make things happen—in galleries, on screens, and around the same table.</p><div class="reading-layout" style="border:0"><p class="eyebrow">For artists. By artists.</p><div class="prose"><p>We’re an artist-and-event collective. Some of us are just getting started. Some have been making work for years. What connects us is the belief that artists can help each other go further.</p><p>That means creating opportunities, sharing what we know, and bringing our online friendships into the places we live. New York, Miami, Denver, Chicago, Paris—and wherever the next good idea takes us.</p><p>Art isn’t a zero-sum game. There’s room to support each other, stay independent, and build something worth being part of.</p></div></div><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">What we do</p><h2>Make space.<br/>Make things happen.</h2></div></div><div class="service-list">{services.map(([title,text],i)=><article class="service-row"><span>0{i+1}</span><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}</div><div class="reading-layout" style="margin-top:60px;border:0"><p class="eyebrow">People make a collective</p><div class="prose"><p>Burrito has grown through the work of artists, organizers, hosts, designers, and friends.</p><p>The original team archive includes Joe, emotionull, Mew_psd, Elysianecstacy, Antholal, Cat Russell, Alhvcard, Averyadzima, Reddy, Marv, and Shauxradio. We keep these names here as part of the collective’s history.</p><p>Recent gatherings have brought us together with Lume Studios, collect.rip, Jet Williams, Max Dona, Le Grand Jeu, Rarible, Shape, Manifold, and the RARI Foundation community.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Let’s work together ↗</a></div></div></section></Layout>
